# AudioGenSkill Routing

- Treat [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) as the repository-level workflow baseline.
- Load the canonical skill under `skills/audiogen/SKILL.md` before using the wrapper in `.cursor/skills/audiogen/`.
- Use `audiogen` for local AudioGen setup guidance, path verification, short SFX generation, and maintenance of the AudioGen skill itself.
- Keep this repository focused on guidance and skill integration, not bundling the full AudioGen installation into git.
